:"WP13005","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1019805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[66,73,31,24,39,60],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1019805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1030","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[66,73,31,24,39,60],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1019805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10048","city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[66,73,31,24,39,60],"title":-1,"rank":"8","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1019805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"汉末军阀之一，后为董卓部将。随吕布等人一同守卫虎牢关。董卓被杀后，与李傕郭汜等人采用贾诩计谋，趁乱占据长安，从王允势力下夺回献帝后，被封为右将军，主持朝政，又击退来袭的马腾、韩遂。后因放走马腾遭李傕怀疑，被设宴杀害。","tc":"漢末軍閥之一，后為董卓部將。隨呂布等人一同守衛虎牢關。董卓被殺后，與李傕郭汜等人采用賈詡計謀，趁亂占據長安，從王允勢力下奪回獻帝后，被封為右將軍，主持朝政，又擊退來襲的馬騰、韓遂。后因放走馬騰遭李傕懷疑，被設宴殺害。","en":"A warlord of the late Han who later served as one of Dong Zhuo's generals. He defended Hulao Gate alongside Lu Bu and others. After Dong Zhuo's assassination, he joined Li Jue, Guo Si, and others in following Jia Xu's scheme to seize Changan during the chaos. After wresting Emperor Xian back from Wang Yun's faction, he was appointed West Commander, administered court affairs, and repelled attacks by Ma Teng and Han Sui. Later, after allowing Ma Teng to escape, he was suspected by Li Jue and killed at a banquet.","jp":"後漢末期の軍閥の一人。後に董卓の部将となった。呂布らと共に虎牢関を守備した。董卓が殺害された後、李傕や郭汜らと共に賈詡の計略を用い、混乱に乗じて長安を占領。王允の勢力から献帝を奪還した後は右将軍に封じられて朝政を執り行い、襲来した馬騰や韓遂を撃退した。後に馬騰を見逃したことで李傕の疑いを買い、宴の席で殺害された。","kr":"후한 말의 군벌 중 한 사람으로, 이후 동탁의 부장이 되었다. 여포 등과 함께 호로관을 지켰다. 동탁이 살해된 후, 이각, 곽사 등과 함께 가후의 계책을 받아들여 혼란을 틈타 장안을 점령했다. 왕윤 세력으로부터 헌제를 되찾은 뒤 우장군에 봉해져 조정을 주관하였으며, 쳐들어온 마등과 한수를 격퇴했다. 훗날 마등을 놓아주었다는 이유로 이각의 의심을 샀고, 결국 연회에 불려 가 살해당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10278","remark":"","surname":"樊","surnameTc":"樊","surnameEn":"Fan","surnameJp":"樊","surnameKr":"번","surnameOther":"","name":"稠","nameTc":"稠","nameEn":"Chou","nameJp":"稠","nameKr":"조","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"樊稠","power":"WJ10048","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1030","gender":"0","rule":"66","force":"73","wise":"31","politics":"24","charm":"39","will":"60","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"2","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"3","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"33/74/33/33/33/11/50/33","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012105","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4300","battleSoulPoint":"5300","debateSoulPoint":"900","strategy":"1003401","strategy2":"1001105","professions":"0/0/3/0/0/0/1/0/0/0/0/0/1/0/2/0/0/0/0/0/0/0/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"99","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5200","evaluate":"-2900","title":"","rank":"8","birth":"149","show":"184","death":"192","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"2","weapon":"WP13005","armor":"WP1008805","helmet":"WP1019805","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;18/1;26/1;57/1;12/0;30/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":""